{"command": "cd /testbed && cat > specs/001-transactions/data-model.md << 'DATAMODEL_EOF'\n# Data Model: TaggedCache\n\n## Entities\n\n### TaggedCache\n\nA bounded cache that wraps `cachetools.LRUCache` for storage and adds tag-based grouping.\n\n**Fields**:\n- `maxsize` (int): Maximum number of entries allowed. Immutable after construction.\n- `_cache` (LRUCache): The underlying LRUCache instance providing bounded storage.\n- `_key_tags` (dict[key, frozenset[str]]): Maps each cached key to its set of tags.\n- `_tag_keys` (dict[str, set[key]]): Maps each tag to the set of keys carrying it.\n\n**Relationships**:\n- Composes (has-a) `LRUCache` for storage.\n- `_key_tags` and `_tag_keys` are bidirectional indexes for tag-based operations.\n\n**State Transitions**:\n1. **Construction**: `maxsize` validated → LRUCache created → empty indexes.\n2. **put(key, value, tags)**: Validate tags → deep-copy value → store in LRUCache → update indexes.\n3. **get(key)**: Look up in LRUCache → deep-copy value → refresh LRU recency → return copy.\n4. **invalidate(tag)**: Look up tag in `_tag_keys` → delete each key from LRUCache → clean indexes → return count.\n5. **Eviction**: LRUCache calls `popitem()` → TaggedCache intercepts → removes key from indexes → returns (key, value).\n\n**Validation Rules**:\n- `maxsize`: Must be `int`, not `bool`, must be > 0.\n- `tags`: Must be iterable of strings; bare `str` rejected; non-string entries rejected.\n- Validation always occurs before any state mutation.\n\n### Tag\n\nA string label attached to a cached entry.\n\n**Fields**:\n- `value` (str): The tag string.\n\n**Validation Rules**:\n- Must be a Python `str` instance.\n- Deduplicated within a single `put()` call.\n\n### CachedEntry\n\nAn internal representation of a stored key-value pair with tags.\n\n**Fields**:\n- `key` (hashable): The cache key.\n- `value` (deep copy): The stored value.\n- `tags` (frozenset[str]): The entry's tags, deduplicated.\n\n**Invariants**:\n- The key exists in `_key_tags` mapping to this frozenset.\n- Each tag in the frozenset has the key in its `_tag_keys` set.\n- The value is stored in the underlying LRUCache.\n\n## Index Consistency\n\nThe two tag indexes must always be consistent:\n- `key in _key_tags[k]` iff `k in _tag_keys[t]` for all `t` in `_key_tags[k]`.\n- On `put(key, value, tags)`: remove key from old tag sets, add to new tag sets.\n- On eviction: remove key from all tag sets.\n- On `invalidate(tag)`: remove tag's keys from `_tag_keys`, clear empty tag entries.\nDATAMODEL_EOF", "exit_code": 0, "stderr": "", "stdout": ""}